[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="InfirmaryCabinet" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(680, 480)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look Through the Grille"
flag_to_set = "cathedral_cabinet_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]The locked cabinet[/b]

Behind the iron grille, a row of stoppered vials, each the colour of weak tea with a pale grit settled at the bottom. The labels read [i]Fever-root, with the deep salt.[/i]

A list hangs inside the door: the houses of Palace Hill, a price beside each name, and a tick when paid. The brass plate on the lock says: \"[i]To be opened only by order of the Prelate.[/i]\"

The cots behind you are full. None of their occupants are on the list."
reexamine_text = "Fever-root and deep salt, for those on the list."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/InfirmaryCabinet"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_110x60")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/InfirmaryCabinet"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Look Through the Grille"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="AdmissionsLedger" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(480, -566)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Admissions Book"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Admissions, this month[/b]

\"[i]Marsh chill[/i]\", eleven times, in the infirmarian's hand. Grey about the lips, sweats at night, a cough that rattles.

In the margin someone has written a single word, [i]GREY[/i], and someone else has scraped it out with a knife, though the pen pressed hard enough that it can still be read."
reexamine_text = "Eleven cases of 'marsh chill'. Someone wrote GREY."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/AdmissionsLedger"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_150x44")

