[node name="FeverMemorial" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-650, -100)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Memorial"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Wall of the Grey Year[/b]

Names cut into the stone, row on row, from the year the fever took the city. Most of the votive candles are lit for the river parishes, the Warrens and the docks.

The great houses of Palace Hill are barely on it at all. A brass plaque at the foot thanks House Ashdown for \"[i]generous provision of grain in the time of need[/i].\""
reexamine_text = "The poor parishes fill the wall. Palace Hill barely appears."

